# What the image build never reads (ADR-724): installs and build output are made afresh inside it,
# and local settings and data stay on the machine they belong to.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.storage
*.rdb
docs
# The pilot's secrets and backups stay on its machine (deploy/pilot, ADR-989).
deploy/pilot/hatti.env
deploy/pilot/backups
